{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-p009a","title":"刘备还下邳兵溃后转广陵","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-p009a-account","label":"《英雄记》","text":"《英雄记》记刘备闻下邳失守而回军，抵达时兵溃；收散卒往广陵，又败于袁术。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p009a-q"]},{"id":"xumisun-a-c6cecdd2708d22c08053","label":"正文","text":"刘备转军广陵海西","evidence":["xumisun-q-6e52b786371896f3be12"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"回军再败","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p009a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"击败刘备","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p009a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"下邳、广陵","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p009a-q"]},"time":{"year":196,"label":"下邳失守后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y196","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o010","basis":"下邳失守后"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-p009a-q","xianzhu-q-o010","wudi-q-o040","wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d"]},"source_order":[32,58,"P009a"],"order":6514}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0057","name":"袁术","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗建安元年：公元 196 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-df2756e12f4ac1fef3c4","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o040","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"建安元年春正月〖1〗，太祖军临武平〖2〗。袁术所置陈相袁嗣，降。太祖将迎天子，诸将或疑；荀彧、程昱劝之。乃遣曹洪将兵西迎。卫将军董承与袁术将苌奴拒险〖3〗，洪不得进。汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-p009a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-ef8a371cd9d1306e2091","layer":"pei","quote":"备闻之，引兵还；比至下邳，兵溃。收散卒东取广陵，与袁术战，又败。","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b611f3a7f8dac2f2633d","start":78,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o010","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-41f463c31e36d9086831","layer":"original","quote":"袁术来攻先主，先主拒之于盱眙、淮阴〖10〗。曹公表先主为镇东将军，封宜城亭侯。是岁，建安元年也。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-6e52b786371896f3be12","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-9dceb360e52be8061153","layer":"original","quote":"先主转军广陵海西","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
